      "statement": "BaseTool is the abstract base class for all LangChain tools extending RunnableSerializable, defining the interface that all tools must implement with required properties including name (unique identifier), description (for model guidance), and optional args_schema (for input validation), along with configuration for execution control (return_direct, response_format, error handling strategies) and callback integration (lifecycle hooks for start, end, error events).",
