      "statement": "Tool execution lifecycle through run() and arun() follows eight stages: configuration (callback setup), callback start, input preparation (parsing and validation), runtime injection (run_manager, RunnableConfig), execution (calling _run/_arun in config context), output processing (format_output wrapping in ToolMessage if tool_call_id set), error handling (ValidationError and ToolException handled per configuration), and callback end.",
